# The Movie Cosmos Naming Convention

Use product naming based on context to keep UX and writing consistent.

## Rules

- UI identity surfaces must use `the movie cosmos` (all lowercase).
- Narrative/product-description text must use `The Movie Cosmos`.
- Do not introduce `TMDB Movie Cosmos` as the primary brand name.
- Historical aliases (for migration context only) are allowed in notes/docs when explicitly marked as alias/history.

## UI Identity Surfaces (lowercase)

- Browser/page title
- Cover title / splash / logo text
- Other direct brand mark placements in HUD or UI chrome

## Narrative Text (title case)

- README and technical/product documentation body text
- Intro/description paragraphs in locales
- Marketing/descriptive sentences and metadata copy

## Quick Examples

- `cover.title` -> `the movie cosmos`
- `<title>` -> `the movie cosmos`
- `info.introBody` -> `The Movie Cosmos ...`
